Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:04.03,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}何万回も挫いて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:08.83,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}全部投げ出しそうだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.64,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}聞き分けない心臓が
