Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:36.19,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}自分自身だけなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:43.11,op jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}超えていけ 憧れたヒーロー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:21.08,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}无论路途多么遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:26.12,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}也曾有勇气迈出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:29.34,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}无论无数次碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:32.14,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}不管跌倒多少次
