Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:53.11,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始终追寻着那日所见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:58.12,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追赶 却怎么也追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:01.32,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑战数千回
